# Sequencing data — never commit these
*.bam
*.bai
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fasta
*.fa
*.fq
*.fq.gz
*.fa.gz
*.fasta.gz
*.sam
*.cram
*.fai
*.gzi
*.mmi
*.dict
